<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in" align="center"><font color="#ff0000"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2"><strong>All the messages you have
sent me for wellness, encouragement and of compassion during the
</strong></font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in" align="center"><font color="#ff0000"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2"><strong>past couple of weeks have
really lifted me. It&rsquo;s also been very humbling! I still have a
relatively long recovery </strong></font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in" align="center"><font color="#ff0000"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2"><strong>to work through, but each
day is just a bit better than the one before. I still sleep a lot to regain
my strength </strong></font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in" align="center"><font color="#ff0000"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2"><strong>as best I can and still at
times need pain medication, but at least I can now get &ldquo;Christian
Voices&rdquo; </strong></font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in" align="center"><font color="#ff0000"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="2"><strong>up and running again!
Thanks very much for your patience and support! Blessings!
&hellip;..Bob</strong></font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in">&nbsp;</p>
