<br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-TOP: 0.07in; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.07in" align="justify"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">Aunt Mary,
a spinster of 92, had finally consented to go to a rest home, but strictly
on a two-week-trial basis. Consequently, she took a small overnight case
with only the bare essentials.</font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-TOP: 0.07in; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.07in" align="justify"><br />
<br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-TOP: 0.07in; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.07in" align="justify"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">A couple of
days later her niece was surprised to get a phone call from her demanding
more clothes.</font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-TOP: 0.07in; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.07in" align="justify"><br />
<br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-TOP: 0.07in; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.07in"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">&quot;Please bring me
that good black silk, my lavender print, the brown wool...&quot; and she
went on and on. Finally after a brief questioning from her niece, Aunt Mary
expostulated:</font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-TOP: 0.07in; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.07in"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">&quot;There are MEN in
this place!&quot; </font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-TOP: 0.07in; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.07in"><br />
<br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in">&hellip;<font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font
